OL,3,GNEWSADaughter reaches settlement with
OL,4,AMoD after mother shot dead by soldiers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe daughter of an IRA woman shot dead
OL,7,Fby British soldiers in west Belfast 55
OL,8,Fyears ago has reached an undisclosed
OL,9,Fsettlement in her claim for damages.
OL,11,FMother-of-four Maura Meehan, 30, and
OL,12,Fher sister Dorothy Maguire,19, were
OL,13,Fshot in the Lower Falls area of the
OL,14,Fcity in October 1971.
OL,16,FThey were said to have been travelling
OL,17,Funarmed in a car when soldiers opened
OL,18,Ffire.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
