OL,3,GNEWSADaughter reaches settlement with
OL,4,AMoD after mother shot dead by soldiers
OL,5,
OL,6,FMargaret Kennedy sued the Ministry of
OL,7,FDefence (MoD) over the circumstances
OL,8,Fsurrounding her mother Maura's death
OL,9,Fand the alleged failure to conduct an
OL,10,Feffective investigation.
